  "bodyHash": "jPHooawZ87w=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一款 Serilum 模组。倾心制作。大量活跃的 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 模组。\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于此模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">侵蚀石类实体模组旨在为玩家提供更可持续的沙子和粘土获取方式。游戏一段时间后，你会拥有成箱的圆石，但建玻璃城堡所需的珍贵沙子却无处可寻。现在，你可以将任意类型的石质方块丢入流动的水流中，150秒后它们就会变成沙子、红沙或粘土。请查看下方兼容方块列表。你无需担心运输物品时石头被侵蚀，只需在水流下方放置冰块即可阻止侵蚀过程。<br><br>水必须流动才能产生侵蚀效果。<br></span><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>默认侵蚀属性，可在配置文件中修改：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>会变成沙子的方块：</em></span><br><em>圆石、苔石、石头、石砖、錾制石砖、裂石砖、平滑石头、沙砾、安山岩、磨制安山岩、闪长岩、磨制闪长岩、花岗岩、磨制花岗岩、砂岩、錾制砂岩、切制砂岩、平滑砂岩、末地石和末地石砖。</em><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>会变成红沙的方块：</em></span><br><em>红砂岩、錾制红砂岩、切制红砂岩、平滑红砂岩、下界岩、下界砖和红色下界砖。<br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">会变成粘土的方块：</span><br>所有未上釉的陶瓦方块。</em></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"前置模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含于 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含于 Serilum's RPG Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"运行环境：服务器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用配置选项：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>durationInSecondsStoneErodes</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 150，最小值 1，最大值 3600</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">石质物品实体在世界中处于水流中时，侵蚀所需的时间（秒）。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>preventErosionIfAboveIceBlock</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，如果物品实体位于冰块上方，则阻止石质方块侵蚀。当你使用水流运输不想被侵蚀的物品时非常有用，只需在水流下方放置冰块即可。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>erodeIntoClayBlockInsteadOfClayBall</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，'itemsWhichErodeIntoClay' 中指定的物品将侵蚀成粘土块而非默认的粘土球。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>itemsWhichErodeIntoSand</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 \"<em>minecraft:cobblestone, minecraft:mossy_cobblestone, minecraft:stone, minecraft:stone_bricks, minecraft:chiseled_stone_bricks, minecraft:cracked_stone_bricks, minecraft:smooth_stone, minecraft:gravel, minecraft:andesite, minecraft:polished_andesite, minecraft:diorite, minecraft:polished_diorite, minecraft:granite, minecraft:polished_granite, minecraft:sandstone, minecraft:chiseled_sandstone, minecraft:cut_sandstone, minecraft:smooth_sandstone</em>\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">在流动水中会侵蚀成普通沙子的物品。以逗号分隔。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>itemsWhichErodeIntoRedSand</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 \"<em>minecraft:red_sandstone, minecraft:chiseled_red_sandstone, minecraft:cut_red_sandstone, minecraft:smooth_red_sandstone, minecraft:netherrack, minecraft:nether_bricks, minecraft:red_nether_bricks</em>\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">在流动水中会侵蚀成红沙的物品。以逗号分隔。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>itemsWhichErodeIntoClay</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 \"<em>minecraft:terracotta, minecraft:white_terracotta, minecraft:orange_terracotta, minecraft:magenta_terracotta, minecraft:light_blue_terracotta, minecraft:yellow_terracotta, minecraft:lime_terracotta, minecraft:pink_terracotta, minecraft:gray_terracotta, minecraft:light_gray_terracotta, minecraft:cyan_terracotta, minecraft:purple_terracotta, minecraft:blue_terracotta, minecraft:brown_terracotta, minecraft:green_terracotta, minecraft:red_terracotta, minecraft:black_terracotta</em>\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">在流动水中会侵蚀成粘土的物品。以逗号分隔。</span></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>以下示例中，配置选项 '<strong>durationInSecondsStoneErodes</strong>' 设为 3 秒。默认情况下，方块需要 2.5 分钟才会侵蚀：</em></span><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>一组方块，部分变成沙子，部分变成红沙：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/eroding-stone-entities/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"556\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>整组物品同样生效：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/eroding-stone-entities/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"556\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>更多方块示例：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/eroding-stone-entities/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"556\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>如果水流下方有冰块，则不会侵蚀上方的方块。此功能可在配置中开关。</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/eroding-stone-entities/d.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"556\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>以及陶瓦方块变成粘土球：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/eroding-stone-entities/e.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"542\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>你可以在任何整合包中自由使用此模组，只要下载链接保持在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统中。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">评论区已关闭，因为我无法在众多模组分页中逐一跟踪评论。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他事宜，请访问&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
